          "selectedEntry": {
            "name": "deep-blend#bundle",
            "owner": "pearjelly",
            "url": "https://github.com/pearjelly/deep-blend/tree/main/packages/deepblend/bundle",
            "page": "https://awesome-dsh-plugin.com/p/pearjelly/deep-blend--packages-deepblend-bundle/",
            "category": "tools",
            "description": {
              "en": "Create editable Blender product scenes in DSH. Start from speaker, cup and lamp recipes or imported models; view saved results on the Lighttable, compare revisions, and adjust dimensions, materials, cameras and lights. Place static models on actual mesh surfaces in one saved operation, then save a complete static view while preserving existing cameras and animation. Render images or saved-shot videos and export an editable revision with its assets. Native geometry inspections, immutable revisions and an approval gate help preserve existing work. Supports DSH 0.2.1-rc.1 and the legacy host, with 20 tools for modeling, review and delivery.",
              "zh": "在 DSH 中创建可编辑的 Blender 产品场景。从音箱、杯与灯具配方或导入模型开始，在光台查看保存结果、比较版本，调整尺寸、材质、相机与灯光。一次操作将静态模型放到实际网格表面并保存，再另存完整静态取景，保留原相机和动画。渲染图片或分镜影片，也可将一个版本连同素材导出为可编辑副本。原生几何检查、不可变历史和审批闸门帮助保留已有作品。适配 DSH 0.2.1-rc.1 并保留旧宿主入口，提供 20 个建模、评审与交付工具。"
            },
            "npm": "@deepblend/dsh-blender-bundle",
